('Caterpillar','603-1668','Basic Water Pump','Cat water pump for certain C15/C18 engines. Cast-iron body and impeller; Cat describes corrosion-resistant stainless-steel shafts and improved oil/coolant seals.',ARRAY['C15','C18']::text[],'Cooling System','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/603-1668','Official Cat product page explicitly lists C15 and C18 in compatible models. Confirm exact arrangement and serial before ordering.','REFERENCE',null,'{"material":"Cast Iron (Body/Impeller)"}'::jsonb,ARRAY['C15','C18']::text[]),
('Caterpillar','284-5565','Water Pump Rebuild Kit','Cat kit containing the parts necessary to rebuild a water pump.',ARRAY['C18','3406E','C15','C-15']::text[],'Cooling System','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/284-5565','Official Cat product page lists compatible models including C18, 3406E and C15. Dimensions published: length 14.8 in, height 9.9 in.','REFERENCE',null,'{"length_in":14.8,"height_in":9.9}'::jsonb,ARRAY['C18','3406E','C15','C-15']::text[]),
('Caterpillar','346-3791','Engine Overhaul (Silver) Kit','Cat Silver in-frame overhaul kit including six pistons, liners, wrist pins, rings, retainers and an unassembled cylinder pack.',ARRAY['3406E']::text[],'Engine Overhaul','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/346-3791','Official Cat product page explicitly lists TRUCK ENGINE 3406E as compatible. Kit contents and quantities are stated on the Cat page.','REFERENCE',null,'{"pistons":6,"liners":6,"wrist_pins":6,"piston_rings":6,"retainers":12}'::jsonb,ARRAY['3406E']::text[]),
('Caterpillar','599-7781','Engine Overhaul (Major) Kit','Cat foundational major-overhaul kit containing gaskets and seals and replacement components including thermostats and gear bushings.',ARRAY['G3516B']::text[],'Engine Overhaul','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/599-7781','Official Cat product page explicitly lists GAS ENGINE G3516B as compatible.','REFERENCE',null,'{}'::jsonb,ARRAY['G3516B']::text[]),
('Caterpillar','0R-4285','3406A Reman Cylinder Pack','Cat Reman cylinder pack containing cylinder liner, piston, rings, pin, retainers, connecting rod and seals; preassembled for installation as a unit.',ARRAY['3406A']::text[],'Engine Overhaul','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/0R-4285','Official Cat product page identifies this SKU as a 3406A Reman Cylinder Pack. No broader compatible-model list was asserted.','REFERENCE',null,'{}'::jsonb,ARRAY[]::text[]),
('Caterpillar','144-0503','Piston & Ring Kit','Cat piston and ring kit. Cat publishes compatible marine engine variants including 3516, 3512, 3508, 3516B and 3512B, and engine applications including 3406B.',ARRAY['3516','3512','3508','3516B','3512B','3406B','3406C','3406E']::text[],'Engine Overhaul','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/144-0503','Official Cat product page lists the stated engine and marine-engine models among its compatible models. Compatibility remains subject to arrangement/serial confirmation.','REFERENCE',null,'{}'::jsonb,ARRAY['3516','3512','3508','3516B','3512B','3406B','3406C','3406E']::text[]),
('Caterpillar','0R-8200','3408/3412 Reman Cylinder Pack','Cat Reman cylinder pack for 3408/3412, 15.5:1 compression ratio; preassembled liner, piston, rings, pin, retainers, connecting rod and seals.',ARRAY['3408E','3412E']::text[],'Engine Overhaul','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/0R-8200','Official Cat product page identifies the 3408/3412 cylinder pack and explicitly lists Industrial Engine 3408E and 3412E in compatible models. Published weight: 35 lb.','REFERENCE',null,'{"compression_ratio":"15.5:1","weight_lb":35}'::jsonb,ARRAY['3408E','3412E']::text[])
